{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, Friend, and welcome to your new life among the hungry. You have many questions, but don't worry. Together we\u2019ll answer the most important question in the Universe: &quot;What's for dinner?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Explore Dynamic Environments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of 4 and explore different environments abandoned by the gods, where every inch of land is rotting away. Churches, labs, mazes\u2014once sanctuaries, now graveyards. Survive god-forsaken storms and anomalous weather as divine punishment rains down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/5aa6363a32cb190aba9b8311c80eaca1.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/5aa6363a32cb190aba9b8311c80eaca1.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/5aa6363a32cb190aba9b8311c80eaca1.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf54 Eat, or Die</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate procedurally generated environments for any scrap of food to sustain you. Eat to Live. Live to Loot. Loot to Survive. Remember A.B.C.: Always Be Chewing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/daee1a3d741e85e9c646298b83f8dc82.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/daee1a3d741e85e9c646298b83f8dc82.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/daee1a3d741e85e9c646298b83f8dc82.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Feed Your Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one wants to dine alone. Work together to combine ingredients, discover new recipes, and boost caloric intake for all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat together, or die faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/13254704ea8e47e74084efbabf04336d.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/13254704ea8e47e74084efbabf04336d.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/13254704ea8e47e74084efbabf04336d.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc79 Instant Death Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the universe is hunting for food. Beyond you and your friends, countless horrors roam: Jack-O-Lantern, Security Guards, Spud Gunslinger, Mothman\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you meet them, either run\u2014or strike first with your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7f3b531ae443b1181d12d96afcec96a6.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7f3b531ae443b1181d12d96afcec96a6.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7f3b531ae443b1181d12d96afcec96a6.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udebd Will the Gods Embrace the Starving?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve eaten enough, it\u2019s time for the retribution. Offer everything to the God of Calories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you eat to satisfy hunger\u2026 or to prepare for the offering?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the Porcelain Altar and present your calories to Calix, the Devourer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/3bf637253c92c6ce4bb57a853b7dad61.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/3bf637253c92c6ce4bb57a853b7dad61.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/3bf637253c92c6ce4bb57a853b7dad61.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 The Forbidden Truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every switch, every door, every shadow hides the key to extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors should never be opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/84267b77a36e5db5a227ff85b36aa466.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/84267b77a36e5db5a227ff85b36aa466.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/84267b77a36e5db5a227ff85b36aa466.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape. Sacrifice. Rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each cycle, you inch closer to the truth\u2014or madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Return to the station. Upgrade. Descend into a harder world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because\u2014Hunger Never Stops.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952820?t=1756408718","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952820?t=1756408718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/1e8f13bd7a360250373031888294ae63a24c148e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756408718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/1e8f13bd7a360250373031888294ae63a24c148e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756408718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, Friend, and welcome to your new life among the hungry. You have many questions, but don't worry. Together we\u2019ll answer the most important question in the Universe: &quot;What's for dinner?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Explore Dynamic Environments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of 4 and explore different environments abandoned by the gods, where every inch of land is rotting away. Churches, labs, mazes\u2014once sanctuaries, now graveyards. Survive god-forsaken storms and anomalous weather as divine punishment rains down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/5aa6363a32cb190aba9b8311c80eaca1.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/5aa6363a32cb190aba9b8311c80eaca1.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/5aa6363a32cb190aba9b8311c80eaca1.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf54 Eat, or Die</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate procedurally generated environments for any scrap of food to sustain you. Eat to Live. Live to Loot. Loot to Survive. Remember A.B.C.: Always Be Chewing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/daee1a3d741e85e9c646298b83f8dc82.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/daee1a3d741e85e9c646298b83f8dc82.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/daee1a3d741e85e9c646298b83f8dc82.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Feed Your Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one wants to dine alone. Work together to combine ingredients, discover new recipes, and boost caloric intake for all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat together, or die faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/13254704ea8e47e74084efbabf04336d.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/13254704ea8e47e74084efbabf04336d.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/13254704ea8e47e74084efbabf04336d.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc79 Instant Death Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the universe is hunting for food. Beyond you and your friends, countless horrors roam: Jack-O-Lantern, Security Guards, Spud Gunslinger, Mothman\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you meet them, either run\u2014or strike first with your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7f3b531ae443b1181d12d96afcec96a6.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7f3b531ae443b1181d12d96afcec96a6.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/7f3b531ae443b1181d12d96afcec96a6.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udebd Will the Gods Embrace the Starving?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve eaten enough, it\u2019s time for the retribution. Offer everything to the God of Calories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you eat to satisfy hunger\u2026 or to prepare for the offering?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the Porcelain Altar and present your calories to Calix, the Devourer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/3bf637253c92c6ce4bb57a853b7dad61.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/3bf637253c92c6ce4bb57a853b7dad61.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/3bf637253c92c6ce4bb57a853b7dad61.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 The Forbidden Truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every switch, every door, every shadow hides the key to extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors should never be opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/84267b77a36e5db5a227ff85b36aa466.poster.avif?t=1756408718\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/84267b77a36e5db5a227ff85b36aa466.webm?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/84267b77a36e5db5a227ff85b36aa466.mp4?t=1756408718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape. Sacrifice. Rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each cycle, you inch closer to the truth\u2014or madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Return to the station. Upgrade. Descend into a harder world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because\u2014Hunger Never Stops.</p>","developers":["Prefabot Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/d4217f94367e55a361211527285a292653619441/header.jpg?t=1756408718","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188175,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188175/movie480.mp4?t=1756408717","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188175/movie_max.mp4?t=1756408717"},"name":" <Desserted> Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188175/0c647dd3298cdef73d30b177b9230515d2cb80c6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756408717","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188175/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756408717","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188175/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756408717"}}],"name":"Desserted","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i7 6700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / AMD 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</str